    "custom_collections_community_L76mjK": {
      "type": "custom-collections-community",
      "blocks": {
        "comment_card_afpCq9": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "macfox is great for cruising around both on road and off road! Have been cruising all around nyc with it and it has made my commute not only faster but way more fun!The Bike has excellent range and the speed is incomparable to other e-bike options! Would definitely recommend for both city life or for cruising trails!",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/commuter-ebike-x7-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Dylan B.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_in8gTP": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "I recently got my hands on an electric bike, and I have to say—it’s an absolute game-changer! From the first ride, I was blown away by the smooth acceleration, effortless pedaling, and the freedom it provides. Whether you’re commuting to work, running errands, or simply exploring the outdoors, an e-bike makes every journey more enjoyable.The pedal-assist feature is a lifesaver, especially on hills or long rides. You still get a workout, but without feeling completely drained at the end of the day. The battery life is impressive, lasting for miles before needing a recharge, and the build quality is solid and reliable.One of the best things about an electric bike is how it eliminates the hassle of traffic and parking. It’s a faster, eco-friendly alternative to driving, saving both time and money. Plus, it’s just plain fun—there’s nothing like cruising effortlessly while feeling the wind on your face.If you’re considering an electric bike, I can’t recommend it enough. It’s a smart investment for both convenience and sustainability, making everyday travel a breeze. Once you ride one, you’ll never want to go back!",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/commuter-ebike-x1s-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Felix D.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_HahxMa": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Great bike for my 13 year olds! Arrived very quickly and was easy to assemble (the kids built it themselves). It’s been fun and safe to ride to school and around town.”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/1_d6dc3ff1-d44b-4c5c-ac32-a21fdc1e0cc9.webp",
            "name": "Erin R.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_keEe34": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Shopping was way quicker than expected and the bike looks sharp!! My son will be so excited to receive this for his 13th birthday next weekend!”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/1_a6e73b7b-04f3-40be-9853-0e89b3f6dcab.webp",
            "name": "Krystle F.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_wYa4yn": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Bought the macfox x7 for my son’s 14th birthday. It’s was super easy to put together. He absolutely loves it! It’s perfect for riding around the neighborhood and going to friends houses.”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/3_e24db871-3c80-4ae0-8423-dc424412cfee.webp",
            "name": "Laura M.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_9h7T6f": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Love the bike! Very comfortable and I love the brakes and fat tires. It is quite a bit slower to get up to speed compared to all my kids x1 bikes but I do like it. Also the throttle switch does stick quite a bite. But we love our bikes! We have 4 of these EBikes”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/4_99e8c581-4e66-44e9-bdea-6a0ed7902568.webp",
            "name": "Chris E.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        }
      },
